sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Developer / reviewer
  participant API as SATRA API<br/>(satra/api.py)
  participant P as Live pipeline<br/>(live_pipeline.py)
  participant I as Ingest + localizer<br/>(ingest.py, diff_localizer.py)
  participant C as Contract<br/>(trust.py, security_contract.py)
  participant SB as Sandbox tests<br/>(contract_runner.py, Docker)
  participant O as Counterfactual oracle<br/>(test_validator.py)
  participant LLM as Ollama<br/>(optional)
  participant D as DecisionEngine<br/>(7 gates)

  R->>API: POST /runs (commit)
  API->>P: run_live_pipeline(run, commit)
  P->>I: fetch repository + commit, build change set
  I-->>P: changed functions mapped to routes, guards, sinks
  P->>C: verify trusted manifest, derive security contracts
  C-->>P: contracts (subject, action, secure outcome, policy rule)
  P->>SB: selected trusted tests on baseline, candidate, candidate again
  SB-->>P: pass / fail counts
  P->>O: mutate baseline (break the guard), run security tests
  O-->>P: does the oracle catch the mutant?
  opt contract exists
    P->>LLM: generate one test for the contract
    LLM-->>P: candidate test (untrusted)
    P->>O: validate on baseline and mutant before use
  end
  P->>D: evaluate gates (manifest, regions, contract, baseline, oracle, repeat)
  D-->>P: ACCEPT / BLOCK / REVIEW
  opt not accepted and findings exist
    P->>SB: bounded deterministic repair, re-verified in sandbox
  end
  P-->>API: ACCEPTED / REJECTED / INCONCLUSIVE + findings + evidence
  opt ACCEPTED
    API-->>R: recommit ready (branch + PR preview)
    R->>API: POST /recommit/approve (explicit human approval)
    API->>API: create repair branch, push if allowed, append audit trail
  end
